  "description": "Spawn-and-go PTY adapter for Exclr8.Terminal. Wires Porta.Pty (cross-platform pseudoterminal: macOS / Linux pty + Windows ConPTY) to a TerminalControl in a single StartAsync call — read loop, writer-lock-serialised input, resize forwarding, process-exit propagation, root-pid tracking, ordered async dispose. Optional sister package — the core control stays PTY-agnostic for SSH / replay / custom transport hosts.",
